    "icon": "umb://media/a0df66c37ac6423084eb3fe30c460542",
    "featureTabTitle": "المنصات العقارية المرخصة",
    "featureBrief": "{\n  \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: right; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">يُتاح للأفراد إمكانية استعراض جميع المنصات العقارية الإلكترونية المرخصة من الهيئة العامة للعقار برخصة فال للوساطة والتسويق العقاري.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<div>\\n<table border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"95%\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormalTable\\\" style=\\\"width: 95.84%; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm; mso-table-dir: bidi;\\\" dir=\\\"rtl\\\">\\n<tbody>\\n<tr style=\\\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\\\">\\n<td width=\\\"16%\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"width: 16.86%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: center; tab-stops: 88.5pt;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">&nbsp;</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: center; tab-stops: 88.5pt;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">&nbsp;</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: center; tab-stops: 88.5pt;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\\\"https://eservicesredp.rega.gov.sa/main/Admin/Requests/sa.aqar.fm\\\">عقار</a></span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: center; tab-stops: 88.5pt;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" cl